          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ensaio is inherited, through Old Portuguese eisaio, from Late Latin exagium \"a weighing, a trial\" (EtymDB), related to exigere \"to weigh out\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
